   Aggregates: COUNT(*)
   DataFusion Physical Plan: 
     : ┌───── DistributedExec
     : │ AggregateExec: mode=Final, gby=[], aggr=[count(1) as agg_0]
     : │   CoalescePartitionsExec
     : │     [Stage 1] => NetworkCoalesceExec: output_partitions=3, input_tasks=3
     : └──────────────────────────────────────────────────
     :   ┌───── Stage 1 ── tasks=3, partitions=3
     :   │ AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[], aggr=[count(1) as agg_0]
     :   │   HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, on=[(id@0, owner_user_id@0)], projection=[]
     :   │     DistributedLeafExec:
     :   │       t0: PgSearchScan: table=u, segments={partial=1, included=1, pruned=2}, partition=id[-∞..1356), visibility=eager, query={"with_index":{"query":{"all":{"field":"id"}}}}
     :   │       t1: PgSearchScan: table=u, segments={partial=1, included=0, pruned=3}, partition=id[1356..1601), visibility=eager, query={"with_index":{"query":{"all":{"field":"id"}}}}
     :   │       t2: PgSearchScan: table=u, segments={partial=1, included=2, pruned=1}, partition=id[1601..∞), visibility=eager, query={"with_index":{"query":{"all":{"field":"id"}}}}
     :   │     DistributedLeafExec:
     :   │       t0: PgSearchScan: table=p, segments={partial=4, included=2, pruned=3}, partition=owner_user_id[-∞..1356), dynamic_filters=1, visibility=eager, query={"with_index":{"query":{"match":{"field":"title","value":"error","tokenizer":null,"distance":null,"transposition_cost_one":null,"prefix":null,"conjunction_mode":false}}}}
     :   │       t1: PgSearchScan: table=p, segments={partial=5, included=0, pruned=4}, partition=owner_user_id[1356..1601), dynamic_filters=1, visibility=eager, query={"with_index":{"query":{"match":{"field":"title","value":"error","tokenizer":null,"distance":null,"transposition_cost_one":null,"prefix":null,"conjunction_mode":false}}}}
     :   │       t2: PgSearchScan: table=p, segments={partial=4, included=2, pruned=3}, partition=owner_user_id[1601..∞), dynamic_filters=1, visibility=eager, query={"with_index":{"query":{"match":{"field":"title","value":"error","tokenizer":null,"distance":null,"transposition_cost_one":null,"prefix":null,"conjunction_mode":false}}}}
